          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <i data-lucide="plug" class="w-4 h-4 text-saas-violet"></i> Connectat amb el vostre ERP
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4 text-saas-violet"></i> Software 100% vostre, sense llicències
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div
          class="relative w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[2rem] bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-200 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] p-2 sm:p-4 anim-float"
        >
          <img
            src="/alcoi/demo-industria.webp"
            width="1280"
            height="720"
            fetchpriority="high"
            alt="Panell de control d'un ERP industrial a mida: comandes actives, qualitat, entregues i alertes de subministrament"
            class="hero-tilt w-full h-auto rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 block"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 sm:gap-x-8 gap-y-2 sm:gap-y-3 mt-10 sm:mt-14 text-slate-400"
        >
          <span class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Ens connectem amb</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Sage</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">A3</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Holded</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Odoo</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Excel</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Google Workspace</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">API a mida</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">WordPress</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Shopify</span>
        </div>
